# What the L4T Megascript (https://github.com/cobalt2727/L4T-Megascript) checks
# for every time it starts. When one is missing, its first step is an
# `apt-get dist-upgrade` as root and the install of the list, so they are in
# the image. software-properties-common is no longer in Debian 13: it comes
# from the compat suite (NXD_COMPAT_PACKAGES in config/nxd.conf).
bash
dialog
gnutls-bin
curl
wget
yad
zenity
lsb-release
software-properties-common
git
